User: I have a legal situation I need help thinking through. It's related to contract dispute with a former employer. I'm working with Maria Santos from Santos Law Office; our next step is housing court. Timeline: We have a settlement conference scheduled and then trial if that fails.. The other party is my former business partner. We're in Maricopa County, Arizona. I have documentation but I'm not s...
